  "created": "2026-11-21T12:17:11.27Z",
  "description": "An embeddable SQL database for .NET with standard SQL by default. It builds its own fast access paths from the queries it runs, so there is no index to design. Tables are typed columns, held in memory or on disk, with ACID transactions over a write-ahead log, larger-than-memory paged storage whose every page is checksummed, exact aggregates (integer sums are 128-bit and throw instead of wrapping), and exact DECIMAL(p, s) columns of up to 18 digits. It is for applications that need dashboards, change feeds and analytics over their own data without running a database server. It also includes similarity search (NEAREST), SQL NULL, AS OF history on paged tables, atomic change batches, and an EvalApp extension with async execution.",
  "id": "EvaluatedApplications.HoloDb",
